flowchart TB
accTitle: Find the first failing boundary in the IoT path
accDescr: Diagnosis branches from connectivity to publication to rule execution and finally destination writes, preventing missing rows from being mistaken automatically for disconnection.
S["No new DynamoDB rows"] --> C{"Device connected?"}
C -->|"no"| A["Network, certificate, IoT policy"]
C -->|"yes"| P{"Publish recorded?"}
P -->|"no"| D["Device application / publish authorization"]
P -->|"yes"| R{"Rule matched and action ran?"}
R -->|"no"| Q["Topic, SQL and rule configuration"]
R -->|"yes"| W{"DynamoDB write succeeded?"}
W -->|"no"| E["Action IAM role, schema, throttling"]
W -->|"yes"| V["Check table, Region and monitoring query"]
